# fm1-reader (https://github.com/charlesvestal/fm1-reader), for the emulator's screen reader: the commit its files come
# from, and the sum of each file the site gets from it (web/emu/build.sh copies exactly these into build/emu/reader/).
# tools/get_reader.sh fetches that commit into build/fm1-reader; web/emu/build.sh checks the files against these sums
# before it copies them, wherever they come from. To move to another commit: read what changed in these files, then
# change the commit and the sums together.
